<li data-start="2202" data-end="2280">
<p data-start="2204" data-end="2280">Yi Ma’s <em data-start="2212" data-end="2230">self-consistency</em> is <strong data-start="2234" data-end="2253">not correctness</strong> → it is <em data-start="2262" data-end="2280">replay coherence</em></p>
