5811 4.79114 4.23874 4.61524 4.58395C4.53479 4.74193 4.47795 4.95354 4.44727 5.32906C4.41595 5.71254 4.41504 6.20609 4.41504 6.91695V13.0839C4.41504 13.7947 4.41594 14.2884 4.44727 14.6718C4.47798 15.0472 4.53477 15.259 4.61524 15.417L4.68555 15.5429C4.86186 15.8304 5.11487 16.0648 5.41699 16.2187L5.54688 16.2744C5.69065 16.3258 5.88016 16.3636 6.16211 16.3867C6.54563 16.418 7.03898 16.4189 7.75 16.4189H12.25C12.961 16.4189 13.4544 16.418 13.8379 16.3867C14.2135 16.356 14.425 16.2992 14.583 16.2187L14.709 16.1474C14.9963 15.9712 15.2308 15.7189 15.3848 15.417L15.4414 15.2861C15.4927 15.1425 15.5297 14.953 15.5527 14.6718C15.5841 14.2884 15.585 13.7947 15.585 13.0839V8.55758L13.3506 8.30953C12.2572 8.18804 11.3976 7.31827 11.2881 6.22359L11.0234 3.58199H7.75ZM12.6113 6.09176C12.6584 6.56193 13.0275 6.93498 13.4971 6.98727L15.5762 7.21871C15.5727 7.13752 15.5686 7.07109 15.5615 7.01266L15.5342 6.85738C15.5005 6.7171 15.4501 6.58135 15.3848 6.45309L15.3145 6.32711C15.2625 6.24233 15.1995 6.16135 15.0928 6.04488L14.6084 5.54879L13.6182 4.55856C13.2769 4.21733 13.1049 4.04904 12.9688 3.94234L12.8398 3.8525C12.7167 3.77705 12.5853 3.71637 12.4482 3.67184L12.3672 3.6484L12.6113 6.09176Z"></path></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Intelligence as Structural Comp…</p></button></span></span>:</p>
<ul data-start="955" data-end="1230">
<li data-start="955" data-end="1008">
<p data-start="957" data-end="1008">Intelligence = <strong data-start="972" data-end="994">effective assembly</strong>, not behavior</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1009" data-end="1141">
<p data-start="1011" data-end="1029">Key distinction:</p>
<ul data-start="1032" data-end="1141">
<li data-start="1032" data-end="1069">
<p data-start="1034" data-end="1069"><em data-start="1034" data-end="1048">memorization</em> = raw accumulation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1072" data-end="1141">
<p data-start="1074" data-end="1141"><em data-start="1074" data-end="1089">understanding</em> = compression that increases future compressibility</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1142" data-end="1230">
<p data-start="1144" data-end="1230">Intelligence lives in a <strong data-start="1168" data-end="1188">dynamical regime</strong> where effective assembly grows internally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1232" data-end="1262">Spherepop OS already provides:</p>
<ul data-start="1264" data-end="1632">
<li data-start="1264" data-end="1325">
<p data-start="1266" data-end="1325">A <strong data-start="1268" data-end="1297">formal notion of assembly</strong> (event log + kernel replay)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1326" data-end="1453">
<p data-start="1328" data-end="1355">A clean separation between:</p>
<ul data-start="1358" data-end="1453">
<li data-start="1358" data-end="1397">
<p data-start="1360" data-end="1397"><em data-start="1360" data-end="1388">authoritative construction</em> (events)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1400" data-end="1453">
<p data-start="1402" data-end="1453"><em data-start="1402" data-end="1421">derived structure</em> (equivalence, relations, views)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1454" data-end="1516">
<p data-start="1456" data-end="1516">Deterministic <strong data-start="1470" data-end="1494">construction history</strong>, not just final state</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1517" data-end="1566">
<p data-start="1519" data-end="1566">Explicit <strong data-start="1528" data-end="1566">reuse via equivalence and collapse</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1567" data-end="1632">
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1632">Explicit <strong data-start="1578" data-end="1607">counterfactual simulation</strong> via speculative branches</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1634" data-end="1663">So the integration thesis is:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1665" data-end="1817">
<p data-start="1667" data-end="1817"><strong data-start="1667" data-end="1817">EAIMR gives a theory of what intelligence is; Spherepop OS gives a formal machine in which that theory can be instantiated, inspected, and tested.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1819" data-end="1952">You are <em data-start="1827" data-end="1832">not</em> adding learning rules.<br data-start="1855" data-end="1858">
You are showing that Spherepop already has the <em data-start="1905" data-end="1951">structural degrees of freedom EAIMR requires</em>.</p>
<hr data-start="1954" data-end="1957">
