C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-latex"><span><span>Because Spherepop OS operates at the level of semantic construction rather 
than linguistic surface form, it avoids conflating compression of symbols 
with abstraction of meaning. Linguistic artifacts are already the result of 
prior abstraction over embodied experience. Systems that operate solely on 
such artifacts may exhibit impressive compression without acquiring access 
to the underlying semantic structure from which those artifacts arose. By 
locating abstraction at the level of event construction and equivalence, 
Spherepop OS functions as a pre-linguistic semantic substrate rather than a 
post-linguistic compression engine.
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="5944" data-end="6021">This directly addresses Yi Ma’s critique of LLMs <strong data-start="5993" data-end="6020">without mentioning them</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="6023" data-end="6026">
<h3 data-start="6028" data-end="6076">F. Strengthen the Conclusion (one paragraph)</h3>
<p data-start="6078" data-end="6114">Add just before the final paragraph:</p>
