</ul>
<p data-start="501" data-end="632">Because of length, I’ll deliver this in <strong data-start="541" data-end="562">multiple messages</strong>, each a <strong data-start="571" data-end="597">contiguous LaTeX block</strong> that you can concatenate verbatim.</p>
<p data-start="634" data-end="742">Below is <strong data-start="643" data-end="660">MESSAGE 1 / N</strong>:<br data-start="661" data-end="664">
<strong data-start="664" data-end="742">Preamble, Abstract, Introduction, Motivation, Yi Ma integration (expanded)</strong></p>
