<p data-start="2342" data-end="2500">So: <strong data-start="2346" data-end="2434">Spherepop OS is a memory-first reasoning substrate with built-in causal faithfulness</strong>, but framed as an operating system rather than a cognitive model.</p>
<p data-start="2502" data-end="2524">Now we formalize that.</p>
<hr data-start="2526" data-end="2529">
<h2 data-start="2531" data-end="2551">2. Paper Outlines</h2>
<h3 data-start="2553" data-end="2592">Paper A — <em data-start="2567" data-end="2592">Spherepop OS (Extended)</em></h3>
<p data-start="2594" data-end="2671"><strong data-start="2594" data-end="2603">Title</strong><br data-start="2603" data-end="2606">
<em data-start="2606" data-end="2671">Spherepop OS: Deterministic Semantic Computation Below Language</em></p>
<p data-start="2673" data-end="2698"><strong data-start="2673" data-end="2697">New conceptual spine</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2699" data-end="2826">
<li data-start="2699" data-end="2746">
<p data-start="2701" data-end="2746">Semantic construction precedes representation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2747" data-end="2789">
<p data-start="2749" data-end="2789">Abstraction is equivalence stabilization</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2790" data-end="2826">
<p data-start="2792" data-end="2826">Reasoning is replay, not narration</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="2828" data-end="2841">Sections</h4>
<ol data-start="2843" data-end="3265">
<li data-start="2843" data-end="2895">
<p data-start="2846" data-end="2895">Introduction (expanded philosophy of computation)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2896" data-end="2931">
